      {
        "player": "What is this machine?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "The ore from the blast mines is unstable, and needs washing quickly before it disintegrates, so the Lovakengj engineers invented this machine to clean it."
      },
      {
        "npc": "The design's a secret; even if someone tried to copy it, they'd never get it quite right. I bet their machine would break down all the time."
